          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ wäl kɛl runi kɛ bädäk päthni, cu luak Kuɔth Nhial nyinkɛ diaal thuɔ̱k kɛ ta̱th ce̱tkɛ luɔtdɛ. Cuɛ jɛ la̱t kɛ run bärɔw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.6.38",
